{"title":"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems\">2005 AMC 12A #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems\">2005 AMC 10A #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/0/b60a29287daa72911c0f1903aae714e3e09cb888.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 7 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/28661ade49aa3bdb1d54a5b4b577895ebdc2f4ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bx - 10 = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" /> have the same solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfb94b41fe33f343b07597fd30a7a24f10ee19c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -8 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } -4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } -2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"422\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/b/49bee65b462e8a8c818434cdd9ac06e62237f961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 7 = 3 \\iff x = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"197\" height=\"15\" />, so we require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/c/cbc2143173e6d95d5ee83994047197c0f17b7a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2b-10 = -2 \\iff -2b = 8 \\iff b = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } -4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"402\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GmOEQzJVAn4\">https://youtu.be/GmOEQzJVAn4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/c_Zxp8iwCD4\">https://youtu.be/c_Zxp8iwCD4</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A\">2005 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.